{
    "_readme": [
        "Machine-readable declaration of the portable MUIO cases this repository ships,",
        "read by MUIOGO's /clews install layer (EAPD-DRB/MUIOGO PR #519+): MUIOGO fetches",
        "the archive, verifies it against the vintage's SHA256SUMS, and imports it.",
        "Ordering rule: vintages are listed NEWEST FIRST, and none carries a vintage-level",
        "'recommended' flag. MUIOGO installs the first listed vintage when none is asked",
        "for, so the newest published model is always the default and every older",
        "vintage stays installable by name. Do not add a vintage-level 'recommended':",
        "it would override this rule.",
        "Publishing a new vintage: add its entry at the TOP of the list in the same",
        "commit that publishes its build directory. Every archive listed must exist under",
        "the vintage's dir and appear in that dir's SHA256SUMS. Older build directories",
        "also carry their predecessors' archives as provenance; list only the vintage's own.",
        "Within a vintage, 'recommended' marks the case to install when none is asked for;",
        "the other cases (environmental accounting layers etc.) are installable by name."
    ],
